{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A troupe of wandering cats performing across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a witch, who disliked the sound of their performances,\u00a0 cast a curse on them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the cats who have turned into blocks because of the witch\u2019s curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game where you match three cat blocks to rescue the cats trapped inside the blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire cats with the Z key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch position before firing with the X key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire special cats with the Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve and relaunch dropped cats with the C key</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/eabd54e97bf70eeed67bb40302114c8b.avif?t=1760252596\" width=144 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 or more cats to level up and strengthen cat blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stronger cat blocks, aim for the highest score within 600 seconds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/20a5f7f2deedd71236193dc90528fce4.avif?t=1760252596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all cats are upgraded, you can enter the shop upon leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can purchase time, score boosts, or further enhance the equipment of normal cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synchro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/240785c0b07e26ea9e19ded45dd83fed.avif?t=1760252596\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, additional effects will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the right combinations to achieve higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When There\u2019s No Place to Put Cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stack blocks incorrectly and have no space to place cats, press R to clear the cats on the map.<br>(However, some score and time will be deducted.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035630?t=1760252596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035630?t=1760252596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/5eb44fc31dd8daeb27f6abc778723d579c4e9eab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760252596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/5eb44fc31dd8daeb27f6abc778723d579c4e9eab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760252596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A troupe of wandering cats performing across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a witch, who disliked the sound of their performances,\u00a0 cast a curse on them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the cats who have turned into blocks because of the witch\u2019s curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game where you match three cat blocks to rescue the cats trapped inside the blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire cats with the Z key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch position before firing with the X key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire special cats with the Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve and relaunch dropped cats with the C key</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/eabd54e97bf70eeed67bb40302114c8b.avif?t=1760252596\" width=144 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 or more cats to level up and strengthen cat blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stronger cat blocks, aim for the highest score within 600 seconds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/20a5f7f2deedd71236193dc90528fce4.avif?t=1760252596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all cats are upgraded, you can enter the shop upon leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can purchase time, score boosts, or further enhance the equipment of normal cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synchro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/240785c0b07e26ea9e19ded45dd83fed.avif?t=1760252596\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, additional effects will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the right combinations to achieve higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When There\u2019s No Place to Put Cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stack blocks incorrectly and have no space to place cats, press R to clear the cats on the map.<br>(However, some score and time will be deducted.)</p>","developers":["\uc54c\uacbd\uc774"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/9cc450c8fa6a4fc653d11b3dfb5b7e8d42f47b72/header.jpg?t=1760252596","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035630/733497543/b232216c6f62eb02fec274229abca3bca8d8c39a/1758172174/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759059392","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035630/733497543/b232216c6f62eb02fec274229abca3bca8d8c39a/1758172174/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759059392","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035630/733497543/b232216c6f62eb02fec274229abca3bca8d8c39a/1758172174/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759059392","id":257200790,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200790/movie480.mp4?t=1759059392","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200790/movie_max.mp4?t=1759059392"},"name":"CatPuzzlePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200790/ead55c6589ad77c1c2cb55d2c587b51273bb8901/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759059392","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200790/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759059392","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200790/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759059392"}}],"name":"Cat Puzzle","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cat Puzzle - $1.99 USD","packageid":1415632,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Cat Puzzle"}],"packages":[1415632],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><